A shell completion script, to stdout

Usage: sverb generate completions [OPTIONS] <SHELL>

Arguments:
  <SHELL>
          The shell

          Possible values:
          - bash:       bash (bash-completion)
          - zsh:        zsh (`_sverb` in `$fpath`)
          - fish:       fish (`sverb.fish` in `completions/`)
          - powershell: PowerShell (`. _sverb.ps1` from the profile)

Options:
      --debug
          Log at debug level and keep recent log lines for the log pane (log files may then contain
          hostnames)

  -h, --help
          Print help (see a summary with '-h')
